    "markdown": "---\nformat: html\necho: false\nwarning: false\ntheme: simplex\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n## Misantrophie\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"container-misantro\" data-question-id=\"misantro\" class=\"question-container\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\" onclick=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\">\n<div class=\"matrix-question-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\"><p>Bitte kreuzen Sie an, wie stark Sie folgenden Aussagen zustimmen oder sie ablehnen.</p>\n</label>\n<table class=\"matrix-question\">\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Stimme voll zu</th>\n<th>Stimme zu</th>\n<th>Keine Meinung</th>\n<th>Lehne ab</th>\n<th>Lehne stark ab</th>\n</tr>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Menschen sind von Natur aus korrupt.</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<div id=\"container-misantro_korrupt\" data-question-id=\"misantro_korrupt\" class=\"question-container\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_korrupt_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\" onclick=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_korrupt_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\">\n<div id=\"misantro_korrupt\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"misantro_korrupt-label\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"misantro_korrupt-label\" for=\"misantro_korrupt\"></label>\n<div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_korrupt\" value=\"1\"/>\n<span>Stimme voll zu</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_korrupt\" value=\"2\"/>\n<span>Stimme zu</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_korrupt\" value=\"3\"/>\n<span>Keine Meinung</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_korrupt\" value=\"4\"/>\n<span>Lehne ab</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_korrupt\" value=\"5\"/>\n<span>Lehne stark ab</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"hidden-asterisk\">*</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Die Geschichte und aktuelle Ereignisse zeigen, dass Menschen von Grund auf böse sind.</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<div id=\"container-misantro_boese\" data-question-id=\"misantro_boese\" class=\"question-container\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_boese_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\" onclick=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_boese_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\">\n<div id=\"misantro_boese\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"misantro_boese-label\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"misantro_boese-label\" for=\"misantro_boese\"></label>\n<div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_boese\" value=\"1\"/>\n<span>Stimme voll zu</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_boese\" value=\"2\"/>\n<span>Stimme zu</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_boese\" value=\"3\"/>\n<span>Keine Meinung</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_boese\" value=\"4\"/>\n<span>Lehne ab</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_boese\" value=\"5\"/>\n<span>Lehne stark ab</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"hidden-asterisk\">*</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Die Erde ist besser dran, wenn Menschen von ihr verschwinden.</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<div id=\"container-misantro_erde\" data-question-id=\"misantro_erde\" class=\"question-container\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_erde_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\" onclick=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_erde_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\">\n<div id=\"misantro_erde\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"misantro_erde-label\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"misantro_erde-label\" for=\"misantro_erde\"></label>\n<div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_erde\" value=\"1\"/>\n<span>Stimme voll zu</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_erde\" value=\"2\"/>\n<span>Stimme zu</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_erde\" value=\"3\"/>\n<span>Keine Meinung</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_erde\" value=\"4\"/>\n<span>Lehne ab</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_erde\" value=\"5\"/>\n<span>Lehne stark ab</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"hidden-asterisk\">*</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Die meisten Menschen sind grundsätzlich gut.</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<div id=\"container-misantro_gut\" data-question-id=\"misantro_gut\" class=\"question-container\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_gut_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\" onclick=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_gut_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\">\n<div id=\"misantro_gut\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"misantro_gut-label\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"misantro_gut-label\" for=\"misantro_gut\"></label>\n<div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_gut\" value=\"1\"/>\n<span>Stimme voll zu</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_gut\" value=\"2\"/>\n<span>Stimme zu</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_gut\" value=\"3\"/>\n<span>Keine Meinung</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_gut\" value=\"4\"/>\n<span>Lehne ab</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_gut\" value=\"5\"/>\n<span>Lehne stark ab</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"hidden-asterisk\">*</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ich bin stolz, ein Teil der Menschheit zu sein</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<div id=\"container-misantro_stolz\" data-question-id=\"misantro_stolz\" class=\"question-container\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_stolz_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\" onclick=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;misantro_stolz_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\">\n<div id=\"misantro_stolz\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"misantro_stolz-label\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"misantro_stolz-label\" for=\"misantro_stolz\"></label>\n<div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_stolz\" value=\"1\"/>\n<span>Stimme voll zu</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_stolz\" value=\"2\"/>\n<span>Stimme zu</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_stolz\" value=\"3\"/>\n<span>Keine Meinung</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_stolz\" value=\"4\"/>\n<span>Lehne ab</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"misantro_stolz\" value=\"5\"/>\n<span>Lehne stark ab</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"hidden-asterisk\">*</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<span class=\"hidden-asterisk\">*</span>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"container-car_preference\" data-question-id=\"car_preference\" class=\"question-container\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;car_preference_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\" onclick=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;car_preference_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\">\n<div class=\"matrix-question-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\"><p>Please indicate your agreement with the following statements.</p>\n</label>\n<table class=\"matrix-question\">\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Disagree</th>\n<th>Neutral</th>\n<th>Agree</th>\n</tr>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>I would buy a gasoline car.</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<div id=\"container-car_preference_buy_gasoline\" data-question-id=\"car_preference_buy_gasoline\" class=\"question-container\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;car_preference_buy_gasoline_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\" onclick=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;car_preference_buy_gasoline_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\">\n<div id=\"car_preference_buy_gasoline\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"car_preference_buy_gasoline-label\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"car_preference_buy_gasoline-label\" for=\"car_preference_buy_gasoline\"></label>\n<div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"car_preference_buy_gasoline\" value=\"disagree\"/>\n<span>Disagree</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"car_preference_buy_gasoline\" value=\"neutral\"/>\n<span>Neutral</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"car_preference_buy_gasoline\" value=\"agree\"/>\n<span>Agree</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"hidden-asterisk\">*</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I would buy an EV.</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<div id=\"container-car_preference_buy_ev\" data-question-id=\"car_preference_buy_ev\" class=\"question-container\" style=\"width: 100%;\" oninput=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;car_preference_buy_ev_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\" onclick=\"Shiny.setInputValue(&#39;car_preference_buy_ev_interacted&#39;, true, {priority: &#39;event&#39;});\">\n<div id=\"car_preference_buy_ev\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"car_preference_buy_ev-label\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"car_preference_buy_ev-label\" for=\"car_preference_buy_ev\"></label>\n<div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"car_preference_buy_ev\" value=\"disagree\"/>\n<span>Disagree</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"car_preference_buy_ev\" value=\"neutral\"/>\n<span>Neutral</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"radio\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"car_preference_buy_ev\" value=\"agree\"/>\n<span>Agree</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"hidden-asterisk\">*</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<span class=\"hidden-asterisk\">*</span>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; position: relative; min-height: 40px;\" class=\"sd-nav-container\">\n<div style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-default action-button sd-enter-button sd-nav-butto